  "factor_name": "Efficient-Trend Reversal, 60D",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "-pct_change(close,60) / (rolling_sum(abs(pct_change(close,1)),60)+1e-12) / (rolling_std(pct_change(close,1),20)*sqrt(252)+1e-8), lagged by 1 day",
    "description": "Fades smooth, efficient 60-day trends and scales the reversal signal by recent annualized volatility. A high value identifies an asset with a strong, smooth prior trend that is attractive for medium-horizon reversal. The one-day lag prevents look-ahead."
